<title>FRANCE: Usinor confirms interest in CSI of Spain.</title>
<headline>Usinor confirms interest in CSI of Spain.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Usinor Sacilor confirmed on Thursday it was interested in Spanish privatisation candidate Corporacion Siderurgica Integral (CSI).</p>
<p>&quot;The group is indeed interested in CSI (privatisation) and holding talks with them,&quot; a company spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
<p>French daily La Tribune reported earlier that Spain may favour a bid placed by Usinor Sacilor in the privatisation of CSI.</p>
<p>La Tribune said other international contenders included British Steel and Italian group Riva but that British Steel may have dropped out of the race.</p>
</text>
